From 11969438abd3cbee3e6af2805422785990698d55 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bench <bench@local>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 12:31:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 23/24] vulkan: gated-delta-net output transform in one
 dispatch (fwht_gdn_tail); FWHT tests run whole graphs

Per-head RMS_NORM * w, swiglu(z, .), the tiled -> grouped head permutation, signs and the FWHT in front of ssm_out
become one dispatch (with the q8_1 epilogue): -144 barriers and launches per Bonsai decode token. The chain is
followed through sources from the RMS_NORM; each intermediate must have one consumer, and its nodes are skipped.
GGML_VK_DISABLE_GDN_TAIL turns it off. Test: GDN_TAIL.

test_fwht_signed and the tests built on it (MUL_MAT_HADAMARD signed, NORM_FWHT, FWHT_MMVQ, GLU_FWHT, GDN_TAIL)
now compute the whole graph and compare the output; node-by-node evaluation never ran the fused kernels.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
